{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_peper_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_peper_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "少年雇傭兵",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_peper_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8efdf1c15d4d047633342562dce5ffa7763352dc1884d754fbb06f21494d6942",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵隊長",
      "text": "怎麼樣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "沒走，還跟在後頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "那丫頭多倔你又不是不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵隊長",
      "text": "......替我再勸勸她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "老格林，我看你是真糊塗了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "現在後悔，當時又何必帶著她出來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "囉嗦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "黑市那單問題不小，兩頭的土豪都想整死對方，現在貨沒了，他們只會把這事甩在我們頭上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "要是不帶上臭丫頭，放城裡她會死得更快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "這我知道，但你現在趕她走，她也沒別的地去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......隨便在路上找個鎮子，能幹活總能有活路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "這話你自己信？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "說真的，為她好，你就該多練練她。她是不是都沒見過血？我是說真格的那種，不是宰兩頭角獸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "老格林，別再做夢了，我們已經在去倫蒂尼姆的路上，以後這些都免不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "她也是個薩卡茲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......行了，你少說兩句。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "這事我心裡有數。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "混蛋，混蛋，大混蛋......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "又把我當小孩，遲早讓你後悔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "喲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "——！敵襲？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "如果真是敵襲，現在你已經沒命了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "啊......什麼嘛，別嚇我啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "我沒閒到要來嚇你，是你警惕性太差，自己嚇自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我是醫療人員，本來就沒那麼擅長戰鬥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "而且剛剛、剛剛是我在想事情，所以才沒有注意......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "行吧，你說是就是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "怎麼，還在生老格林的氣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "......哼，當然了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "居然在這種時候說要趕我走，你不覺得格林他過分嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我也是雇傭兵，我是小隊的成員，他為什麼要趕我走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "為什麼不讓我和你們一起去倫蒂尼姆？明明我都跟隊出過那麼多次任務了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "這次不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我沒看出有什麼特別的......要去的地方是有一點遠，不過報酬也很豐盛啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "真要說有什麼不一樣的話......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我記得格林那天回來，宣佈我們要立刻啟程的時候的樣子。我從沒見他那麼激動過......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "他平時好像對什麼都無所謂，但那時候不太一樣。他還說，只要這次打贏了，我們就能過上好日子了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "這是真的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "......誰知道呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "我只想先拿到錢，其他的我沒想過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "格林總覺得我什麼都不懂，可我們雇傭兵不就是能賺到錢就好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "只要能養活姥姥，幹什麼活不都一樣嘛。其他的，還要懂什麼啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "要是真能拿到那筆錢......我想替姥姥換個更好點的房子，現在住的地方下雨天會進水，奶奶總說膝蓋痛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "哦，對了，如果格林想要的話，我還能給他買點更好的生日禮物......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "你還在想著幫他過生日？他還記得自己哪天生這麼無聊的事情？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "哪裡無聊了？明明很有意義啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "如果不每年提醒一下自己，真的可能會忘記一年就這麼又過去了，忘記自己又長大一歲，又老去一歲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "你不覺得這還挺可怕的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "......大概？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "這算是什麼回答，好敷衍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "我說不過你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "依我看，你要是直接把這話說給格林本人聽，搞不好他就同意......不對，也有可能他就更不同意你跟著一起來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "欸？什麼意思......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "（本來還想勸勸這丫頭......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "（算了吧。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "沒什麼。你就繼續跟著吧，我先回前頭去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "幹嘛啊，最討厭說話說半截的人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "神神秘秘的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "對方已經離開。前方的隊伍有大約二十人，明椒只能隱約看到最末尾的人的一道影子。\n女孩沉默片刻，垂下頭，從口袋裡掏出了什麼東西。\n那是一隻毛線織的，顏色鮮亮的指套。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "格林肯定又要說顏色太亮了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "有什麼關係，就是要鮮豔一點才好看嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "......要是再趕我走......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "就不把禮物給他了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "（什麼聲音？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "（......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "（......錯覺嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "什麼人！出來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "呵！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "打中了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "你到底是什麼人，有什麼目的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "喂，你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "等等......別想跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "呼......哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "追、追上你了......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "text": "......沒想到會被個小姑娘發現。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "......那被小姑娘抓到的你又算什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "你已經跑不掉了，快說！你是什麼人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "text": "哈，天真的小鬼。我承認你身手不錯，你們薩卡茲在這一行的名聲不虛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "text": "但你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "text": "腦袋空空的天真小鬼就算身手不錯，也只是小鬼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "你......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "（......不行，明椒，對方是故意在激怒你......不能中計，要冷靜下來......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我警告你，別想靠說廢話拖延時間......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "快點回答我的問題，否則我就要動手了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "text": "免費給你上一課，薩卡茲小鬼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "回答我的問題！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "text": "既然知道對方是在拖延時間，就不該繼續等下去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "什麼，你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手B",
      "text": "說完了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手B",
      "text": "你和這小丫頭廢話真多！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "糟了！你、你們......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "text": "——動手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "可惡！你們......卑鄙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "（不行，兩邊一起攻擊的話......躲不過去！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "嗚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "別閉眼！盯住對手，架起武器格擋！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "text": "嘁，麻煩的傢伙來了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "別管其他人，盯緊你認準的獵物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "不要怕受傷，戰鬥中永遠不要放開手裡的武器！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "是、是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手B",
      "text": "別太小看人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "就是現在！攻擊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "哈啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "text": "呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "哈......哈哈！說什麼別小看人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "這句話該我說——你們這些混蛋，別太——小看我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手B",
      "text": "哈，死小鬼，你在瞄準哪裡？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "你在幹什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "我教你的都忘了嗎！攻擊敵人的要害！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我、我知道......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "哈啊啊啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "哈......哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "都收拾掉了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "格林！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "你看到了嗎？我把這兩個混蛋都打趴下了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "格林......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "你怎麼了，你、你在生氣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "我之前是怎麼教你的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "不能輕敵，不能留手，對敵人要一擊致命......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "你是怎麼做的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我......剛剛我不是故意打偏的，只是，呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "這不是還有你在嘛，不會有問題的啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "如果以後......如果我不在呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "可是，可是格林你怎麼會不在？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......沒人能保證會一直在，別太天真了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑市打手",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "他們都還活著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "呃......是的，我、我把他們打暈了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "為什麼不直接殺了他們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "這......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "沒必要吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "對了，不如我把他們綁起來吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "這樣的話，他們就沒法通風報信......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "明椒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "你看好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "上年紀的雇傭兵拔出腰間的利刃，在年輕人的注視下將其送入戰敗者的咽喉。\n赤紅的血濺落在明椒的護膝上，鞋面上，滾燙的熱度透過布料灼燒皮膚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "這......為什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "他們是黑市的人，是衝著我們來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "如果剛剛我沒有察覺到這裡的動靜，今天這樣躺在這裡的就會是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "......我明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我知道他們沒安好心！要不是格林你在，我剛剛就危險了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "還有一個。他是我的獵物，我來了結他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "（要殺了他......對，我該殺了他。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "（只要這樣刺下去，放輕鬆，明椒，這很簡單......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "......呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "你還在猶豫什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我沒有猶豫......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "（我沒有猶豫......我是個雇傭兵，殺人而已......殺掉敵人而已！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "（這有什麼好猶豫的？我、我......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我現在就......現在就殺了他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "到此為止。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "什麼？但是格林，我還沒有——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "你下不了手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "不！你相信我......我可以！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "你根本還什麼都不明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "如果連這樣的人你都沒法下手，我可以斷言，你沒法繼續做雇傭兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "你很快就會死。死在某個戰場上，這倒算是還不錯的結局了，你甚至可能死在一個無關緊要的地方，還得我去給你收屍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "......但我就是雇傭兵啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我們這樣的雇傭兵總有一天都會死，這不是你說的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "我們這樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "哈，你我可不一樣......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "......格林，有的時候我會覺得很害怕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "怕什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "就像格林你說的那樣，今天倒在這的可能是我，如果格林你不在，我就會這樣被殺掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "你們有可能會在很久之後才發現我，然後要等更長時間，在小鎮上的姥姥才會收到這個消息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "之前弗雷德出事的時候，就是這樣。我一直記得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "生離死別是常事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "嗯......我知道，你經常這麼說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我不怕死，真的不怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "但我怕有一天我真的回不去了，姥姥卻還一直等我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "這一次就這麼算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "格林......！不，等等，我真的可以——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "我看夠鬧劇了，所以到此為止。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "但是臭丫頭，你記住了，要是繼續跟著我們走下去，你總還會遇到必須要動手的時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "嗯......我明白......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "你明白？我看不見得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......這樣或許會害了你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "明椒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "別去倫蒂尼姆了，你不合適。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "可是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "格林你不是說，只要這次能打贏，我們就能有好日子過了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我能戰鬥，我一定可以幫上忙的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "這不光是戰鬥的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "我會把我的一切壓在這次的任務上，那是因為我曾經見過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "見過什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "我見過我們薩卡茲有家的樣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "家......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "也許沒那麼好，但只要有一點可能，我就願意拼一把。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "可你不同。你還能有選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我......我的選擇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我不知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "除了跟著大家一起，我還能去哪呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "我想回小鎮，繼續像之前一樣過日子，可是......我們真的能嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "其實我有想過的，這次去倫蒂尼姆的任務，比之前的所有任務都要難，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "算是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "未來有一天，可能格林你也會倒在什麼地方，就這麼丟了命......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "......那我就不給你準備明年的生日禮物了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "給你，今年的禮物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......指套？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "不許說太鮮豔！不許說浪費時間！不許說不需要！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "你、你要是死掉，我是不會傷心的，我保證。對我們薩卡茲來說，生離死別不算什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "但如果可以不死......不管是被狠狠揍一頓也好，還是拿不到報酬也好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "怎麼樣都行。白跑一趟賺不到錢也沒什麼，我都不介意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "至少......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "至少我希望在任務結束之後，大家還能一起回來......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......天真的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "薩卡茲的年輕人難道都像你這麼天真？我知道的薩卡茲不該這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "怎麼又罵我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "難道薩卡茲就不能希望身邊的人都平安了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "可我就是這麼想的......我就是薩卡茲啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "這樣的薩卡茲總會死在戰場上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "......我可不想看到你的死相，臭丫頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格林",
      "text": "走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "text": "什麼意思......哎，等等我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
